-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §7: the definitions for the agreement —
-- teaching employee, teacher, mother teacher, academic teacher and academic
-- degree, certified, senior and uncertified teacher, existing and new
-- teacher, principal, deputy principal (first and second), educational
-- counsellor and kindergarten teacher.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-3`
§ `7`

§§ `7(א)–(ב) Teaching employee and teacher`

-- (א): a teaching employee is one §3 covers; the rule is §3's.
@ref akn:art_7__para_a
GIVEN e IS A `employee under section 3`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a teaching employee` e IF
    `the agreement covers` e

-- (ב): one who teaches pupils aged 6 to 18 who study in official
-- educational institutions.
@ref akn:art_7__para_b
GIVEN `teaches pupils aged 6 to 18` IS A BOOLEAN, `in official educational institutions` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a teacher` `teaches pupils aged 6 to 18` `in official educational institutions` IF
    `teaches pupils aged 6 to 18` AND `in official educational institutions`

§§ `7(ג) Mother teacher`

@desc Who raises the teacher's children, as far as 7(ג) asks.
DECLARE `parent status` IS ONE OF
    `a mother`
    `a divorced parent with custody by a valid divorce agreement or judgment`
    `a parent in divorce proceedings raising the children alone, by the welfare authorities' confirmation`
    `a widowed parent raising the children alone`
    `another parent`

-- (ג): a teacher whose position is not less than 79%, the mother of a
-- child "עד גיל 14" at the start of the school year; and a teacher in whom
-- the same conditions hold who was married and was given custody of the
-- children, is in divorce proceedings raising them alone, or is widowed
-- raising them alone. "עד גיל 14" follows convention thresholds.until: a
-- child under 14. (¶2: an adopted child is a child.)
@ref akn:art_7__para_c akn:art_7__para_c/p2
GIVEN `position fraction` IS A NUMBER
      `age of the youngest child at the start of the school year` IS A NUMBER @desc an adopted child included (¶2)
      status IS A `parent status`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a mother teacher` `position fraction` `age of the youngest child at the start of the school year` status IF
        `position fraction` AT LEAST 0.79
    AND `age of the youngest child at the start of the school year` LESS THAN 14
    AND NOT status EQUALS `another parent`

#ASSERT `a mother teacher` 0.79 13 `a mother`
#ASSERT NOT `a mother teacher` 0.78 3 `a mother`
#ASSERT NOT `a mother teacher` 1 14 `a mother`
#ASSERT `a mother teacher` 1 5 `a widowed parent raising the children alone`

§§ `7(ד)–(ה) Academic teacher and academic degree`

DECLARE `degree institution` IS ONE OF
    `a recognised institution of higher education in Israel`
    `a recognised institution abroad, the degree approved as equivalent`
    `an institution abroad, the degree not approved as equivalent`
    `another institution`

-- (ה): a degree from an institution recognised by the Council for Higher
-- Education (section 9 of its law), or from a recognised institution abroad
-- whose degree the evaluation department has approved as equivalent.
@ref akn:art_7__para_e
GIVEN i IS A `degree institution`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an academic degree` i IF
        i EQUALS `a recognised institution of higher education in Israel`
    OR  i EQUALS `a recognised institution abroad, the degree approved as equivalent`

-- (ד): a teacher with an academic degree; and, for this agreement only, a
-- teacher on a salary grade equivalent to an academic one approved by the
-- Ministry's teaching personnel division or a district's.
@ref akn:art_7__para_d
GIVEN degree IS A MAYBE `degree institution`
      `on an approved grade equivalent to an academic one` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an academic teacher` degree `on an approved grade equivalent to an academic one` IF
    CONSIDER degree
    WHEN JUST i THEN `an academic degree` i OR `on an approved grade equivalent to an academic one`
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `on an approved grade equivalent to an academic one`

#ASSERT `an academic teacher` (JUST `a recognised institution of higher education in Israel`) FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `an academic teacher` (JUST `an institution abroad, the degree not approved as equivalent`) FALSE
#ASSERT `an academic teacher` NOTHING TRUE

§§ `7(ו)–(ח) Certified, senior and uncertified teacher`

-- (ו): a certified teacher holds one of five qualifications.
@ref akn:art_7__para_f
DECLARE `teaching qualification` IS ONE OF
    `a certified or senior certified teacher's certificate from a recognised Israeli teacher-training institution`
    `certification on the strength of reserve examinations`
    `a permanent teaching licence for post-primary education`
    `a licence to practise teaching`
    `a university teaching certificate from Israel`
    `a qualification the clause does not list`

@ref akn:art_7__para_f__subpara_1 akn:art_7__para_f__subpara_2 akn:art_7__para_f__subpara_3 akn:art_7__para_f__subpara_4 akn:art_7__para_f__subpara_5
GIVEN qs IS A LIST OF `teaching qualification`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a certified teacher` qs IF
    any (GIVEN q YIELD NOT q EQUALS `a qualification the clause does not list`) qs

-- (ז): a senior teacher is a senior certified teacher who got the rank by
-- finishing studies at a teacher-training college that gave it, or by a
-- certificate (for the salary grade) given on the strength of in-service
-- training.
@ref akn:art_7__para_g
DECLARE `how the senior rank was got` IS ONE OF
    `finishing studies at a teacher-training college that gave the rank`
    `a certificate for the salary grade, on the strength of in-service training`
    `another way`

@ref akn:art_7__para_g__subpara_1 akn:art_7__para_g__subpara_2
GIVEN `a senior certified teacher` IS A BOOLEAN, how IS A `how the senior rank was got`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a senior teacher` `a senior certified teacher` how IF
    `a senior certified teacher` AND NOT how EQUALS `another way`

-- (ח): an uncertified teacher has no certificate of certification to
-- teach. F-ofek-hadash-base-7-b: (ו) counts as certified the holder of a licence ((3), (4))
-- and of a university teaching certificate ((5)); such a teacher holds no
-- "תעודת הסמכה להוראה" and is, by the words of (ח), uncertified as well.
-- The reading adopted: (ח) is the complement of (ו).
@ref akn:art_7__para_h
GIVEN qs IS A LIST OF `teaching qualification`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an uncertified teacher` qs IF
    NOT `a certified teacher` qs

-- (ח) as printed: no certificate of certification, which the licences and
-- the university certificate are not.
GIVEN q IS A `teaching qualification`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is a certificate of certification to teach` q IF
        q EQUALS `a certified or senior certified teacher's certificate from a recognised Israeli teacher-training institution`
    OR  q EQUALS `certification on the strength of reserve examinations`

GIVEN qs IS A LIST OF `teaching qualification`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `uncertified by the words of (ח)` qs IF
    NOT any `is a certificate of certification to teach` qs

`a licensed teacher is both certified and, by the words of (ח), uncertified` MEANS
        `a certified teacher` (LIST `a licence to practise teaching`)
    AND `uncertified by the words of (ח)` (LIST `a licence to practise teaching`)
#ASSERT `a licensed teacher is both certified and, by the words of (ח), uncertified`
#ASSERT NOT `an uncertified teacher` (LIST `a licence to practise teaching`)

§§ `7(ט)–(י) Existing and new teacher`

DECLARE `state on an eve` IS ONE OF
    `taught or managed a school for the State, the year recognised as seniority for pay`
    `on unpaid leave, a sabbatical or another unpaid permitted absence, as a teaching employee of the Ministry`
    `neither`

GIVEN s IS A `state on an eve`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `meets a condition of 7(ט)(1)` s IF
    NOT s EQUALS `neither`

@desc A teaching employee, as far as 7(ט)–(י) ask.
DECLARE `teacher's history` HAS
    `on the eve of the signing`                IS A `state on an eve`
    `on the eve of the move to the reform`     IS A `state on an eve`
    `began in the civil service in 5768 or later` IS A BOOLEAN
    `years of teaching elsewhere recognised for seniority` IS A NUMBER @desc at an employer other than the civil service, or in the civil service not under the reform before a break; without the internship year and IDF or national service in teaching (¶2)

-- (ט)(1): one of the conditions held both on the eve of the signing and on
-- the eve of the teacher's own move to the reform.
@ref akn:art_7__para_i akn:art_7__para_i__subpara_1 akn:art_7__para_i__subpara_1__cls_a akn:art_7__para_i__subpara_1__cls_b
GIVEN h IS A `teacher's history`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `existing under 7(ט)(1)` h IF
        `meets a condition of 7(ט)(1)` (h's `on the eve of the signing`)
    AND `meets a condition of 7(ט)(1)` (h's `on the eve of the move to the reform`)

-- (ט)(2): began in the civil service in תשס"ח or later and is entitled to
-- recognition, for seniority, of years of teaching elsewhere; ¶2 counts
-- those years without the internship year and without IDF or national
-- service in teaching (§37), for (2) only.
@ref akn:art_7__para_i__subpara_2 akn:art_7__para_i__subpara_2/p2
GIVEN h IS A `teacher's history`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `existing under 7(ט)(2)` h IF
        h's `began in the civil service in 5768 or later`
    AND h's `years of teaching elsewhere recognised for seniority` GREATER THAN 0

GIVEN h IS A `teacher's history`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an existing teacher` h IF
    `existing under 7(ט)(1)` h OR `existing under 7(ט)(2)` h

-- (י): a new teacher is one who is not an existing teacher.
@ref akn:art_7__para_j
GIVEN h IS A `teacher's history`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a new teacher` h IF
    NOT `an existing teacher` h

`a teacher who joined in 5769 with no earlier years` MEANS
    `teacher's history` WITH
        `on the eve of the signing`                 IS `neither`
        `on the eve of the move to the reform`      IS `neither`
        `began in the civil service in 5768 or later` IS TRUE
        `years of teaching elsewhere recognised for seniority` IS 0
#ASSERT `a new teacher` `a teacher who joined in 5769 with no earlier years`

`a teacher on a sabbatical at the signing who taught on the eve of the move` MEANS
    `teacher's history` WITH
        `on the eve of the signing`                 IS `on unpaid leave, a sabbatical or another unpaid permitted absence, as a teaching employee of the Ministry`
        `on the eve of the move to the reform`      IS `taught or managed a school for the State, the year recognised as seniority for pay`
        `began in the civil service in 5768 or later` IS FALSE
        `years of teaching elsewhere recognised for seniority` IS 0
#ASSERT `an existing teacher` `a teacher on a sabbatical at the signing who taught on the eve of the move`

§§ `7(יא)–(יד) Principal and deputies`

-- (יא): serves as principal of an official educational institution and was
-- appointed under the director-general's circular on appointing principals;
-- not the principal of a school that includes an upper division.
@ref akn:art_7__para_ja
GIVEN `principal of an official institution` IS A BOOLEAN
      `appointed under the director-general's circular` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the school includes an upper division` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a principal` `principal of an official institution` `appointed under the director-general's circular` `the school includes an upper division` IF
        `principal of an official institution`
    AND `appointed under the director-general's circular`
    AND NOT `the school includes an upper division`

-- (יב)–(יד): a deputy principal is appointed under the circular on
-- appointing deputies; the first deputy is the one appointed to that role
-- under the binding rules, and where the school has one deputy, that one;
-- every other deputy is a second deputy.
@ref akn:art_7__para_jb
GIVEN `deputy of an official institution` IS A BOOLEAN, `appointed under the director-general's circular` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a deputy principal` `deputy of an official institution` `appointed under the director-general's circular` IF
    `deputy of an official institution` AND `appointed under the director-general's circular`

DECLARE `deputy rank` IS ONE OF `first deputy`, `second deputy`

@ref akn:art_7__para_jc akn:art_7__para_jd
GIVEN `deputies in the school` IS A NUMBER, `appointed as first deputy` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `deputy rank`
DECIDE `the deputy's rank` `deputies in the school` `appointed as first deputy` IS
    IF `deputies in the school` EQUALS 1 OR `appointed as first deputy`
    THEN `first deputy`
    ELSE `second deputy`

#ASSERT `the deputy's rank` 1 FALSE EQUALS `first deputy`
#ASSERT `the deputy's rank` 3 FALSE EQUALS `second deputy`

§§ `7(טז)–(יז) Educational counsellor and kindergarten teacher`

-- (טז): part of the school's educational staff, working in mental health and
-- the wellbeing of pupil, staff and parent, and holding a permanent or
-- temporary licence in educational counselling.
@ref akn:art_7__para_ig
GIVEN `part of the educational staff in mental health and wellbeing` IS A BOOLEAN, `holds a counselling licence` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an educational counsellor` `part of the educational staff in mental health and wellbeing` `holds a counselling licence` IF
    `part of the educational staff in mental health and wellbeing` AND `holds a counselling licence`

-- (יז): "גננת – למעט …" lists only whom the term leaves out — an
-- integrating kindergarten teacher, a paramedical one, a cluster manager, a
-- Milo"a teacher, a hospital kindergarten teacher — and ends there (F-ofek-hadash-base-7-a):
-- it never says who IS a kindergarten teacher. The reading adopted: a
-- teacher in a kindergarten, the listed kinds excepted.
@ref akn:art_7__para_jg
DECLARE `kindergarten post` IS ONE OF
    `a kindergarten teacher in a kindergarten`
    `an integrating kindergarten teacher`
    `a paramedical kindergarten teacher`
    `a kindergarten cluster manager`
    `a Milo"a kindergarten teacher (arts-enrichment centre)`
    `a hospital kindergarten teacher`

GIVEN p IS A `kindergarten post`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a kindergarten teacher` p IF
    p EQUALS `a kindergarten teacher in a kindergarten`

-- What (יז) says of a post: only that it is excluded. Of the one post it
-- does not exclude it says nothing.
GIVEN p IS A `kindergarten post`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
DECIDE `what 7(יז) says of` p IS
    IF p EQUALS `a kindergarten teacher in a kindergarten` THEN NOTHING ELSE JUST FALSE

`7(יז) defines no one in, only out` MEANS
    isNothing (`what 7(יז) says of` `a kindergarten teacher in a kindergarten`)
#ASSERT `7(יז) defines no one in, only out`
